encoding byte
engine vm
ms 0 "\x22https://www.acme.com/a?tld=de\x22 x" 1 30
ms 1 "\x22https://www.acme.com/a?tld=de\x22 x" 1 30
ns 2 "\x22https://www.acme.com/a?tld=de\x22 x"
